LRC AS A CONSTRAINED TOURNAMENT-CLASS PROBLEM (S512)
====================================================================================================
Raw A000568 classes are the base.  LRC needs a runner-clock walk in a
decorated fiber over that base: observer mark, safe mask, gap marks, or
pair-cell deficit marks.  The question is which decoration is minimal.

