SYNTHESIS
====================================================================================================
1. The open half-turn runner clock lands in a circular-menu subset of
   A000568 classes.  Equality walls form a tie-path compactification
   that can add many boundary classes, so tight LRC states need the
   boundary fiber, not only the open circular menu.
2. For LRC itself, unmarked phase class is too coarse: good and bad
   states live in the same A000568 class.  This is the first warning.
3. Pure gap-rank and pair-deficit rank are still too coarse.  The
   first separating objects are threshold-decorated fibers over the
   A000568 base: gap-rank plus 1/n gap colors, or pair-deficit plus
   zero/nonzero danger colors.
4. A future n=14 proof by this route would likely show that the hard
   quotient-ladder walk is trapped in the circular/pair-cell fiber and
   must hit a good-only decorated class before closing.
